<title>UK: Telkom at $32.3 in London.</title>
<headline>Telkom at $32.3 in London.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>PT Telekomunikasi Indonesia (Telkom) closed at $32.3 in London on Tuesday. It recorded the day's low of $32 and the day's high of $32.375.</p>
<p>Its previous close on Monday as $32.375.</p>
<p>One ADS represents 20 ordinary shares.</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364.</p>
</text>
